WEBVTT
Kind: captions
Language: en

00:00:00.030 --> 00:00:07.379
The multi-device experiences platform, or
MDX, is an extensible cloud AI service

00:00:07.379 --> 00:00:14.519
hosted in Azure. MDX enables research and
development on task-focused scenarios

00:00:14.519 --> 00:00:19.920
that span multiple devices, empowering
first and third party developers to

00:00:19.920 --> 00:00:25.109
build intelligent and interactive
experiences that capitalize on the

00:00:25.109 --> 00:00:33.239
convenience, efficiency, and strengths of
multi device usage throughout a task. The

00:00:33.239 --> 00:00:39.829
MDX platform, enabling research and
development in multi device experiences.

00:00:39.829 --> 00:00:46.789
Check out how the power of MDX could
enhance even the simplest of daily tasks.

00:00:46.789 --> 00:00:52.289
Alexa ask chef to show me that paella recipe
I looked at last night. Here is the

00:00:52.289 --> 00:00:59.120
recipe for traditional Paella Valenciana.
All right, let's cook.

00:01:04.860 --> 00:01:15.009
How much rice do I need? 350 grams Paia
rice. How many cups is that? It is 1-3/4 cups.

00:01:15.009 --> 00:01:32.740
I don't have green beans. Can I
replace the green beans or something

00:01:32.740 --> 00:01:37.200
else? Yes you could use snap peas instead.

00:01:38.640 --> 00:01:43.240
Add green beans to my grocery list. I
have added green beans to your grocery

00:01:43.240 --> 00:01:45.750
list.

00:01:46.300 --> 00:01:52.340
Okay what's the next step?
Pour in about a liter of the chicken

00:01:52.340 --> 00:01:54.640
stock.

00:01:58.900 --> 00:02:03.260
Are there any wines that would pair well
with this recipe? How about a chilled dry

00:02:03.260 --> 00:02:10.370
Rosatto from Navarra?

00:02:12.130 --> 00:02:16.510
Can you let me know when this step is
done? I'll start a 10-minute timer for you.

00:02:16.510 --> 00:02:53.820
Ten minutes is up. Time for the next step.Thanks MDX

